4323726066132,1240],[46.777263885528086,9.544151376730099,1240],[46.777327796351386,9.544101480974561,1240],[46.77736400649681,9.54408979785169,1240],[46.77740872612313,9.544104644334103,1240],[46.77744421218934,9.544132228432268,1240],[46.77748869044532,9.544160164061465,1240],[46.77748869044532,9.544160164061465,1240],[46.777517115199764,9.544082683968519,1240],[46.77757203379437,9.54403243642242,1239],[46.77765368761175,9.543996332302097,1239],[46.77767191335125,9.543983946104456,1239]]]},"properties":{"land":"mountainbike","category":"local","language":"en","start":"Churwalden","end":"Churwalden","via":null,"abstract":"The Churwalden Tour is the ideal after-work tour. With little in the way of altitude difference and technical/fitness requirements it is also suitable for families and e-bikes.","foto":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0819b_s.jpg","foto_urls":null,"foto_master":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-master/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0819b_M.jpg","foto_big":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0819b_g.jpg","foto_standard":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0819b_s.jpg","foto_small":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-small/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0819b_k.jpg","foto_abstract":null,"logo":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_Churwaldner_Tour_140px.jpg","logo_svg":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-svg/ML_613_Churwaldner-Tour.svg","x_coordinate":760228.0807202804,"y_coordinate":183435.32769785734,"description":"The starting point of this tour is the information office in Churwalden. The tour begins with a gentle section to the monastery dating back to the 12th century on the edge of the village of Churwalden. The route then continues on a gravel road in the direction of Eggentobel and on to the picturesque alpine village of Pradaschier, offering a lovely view over Churwalden and special fun on Switzerland's longest toboggan run. The tour continues with a short downhill section and the crossing of the Rabiosa stream back to Churwalden.\n\nA detour to the heated outdoor swimming pool in Churwalden is ideal for a little well-earned rest and relaxation, ending the day in style. Several restaurants along the route invite to linger for awhile. The route is suitable for beginners, families, and e-bikes.","length":9,"length_asphalt":2,"length_unsurfaced":5,"length_singletrail":2,"height_difference":420,"height_difference_back":420,"height_downwards":null,"hiking_time":null,"hiking_time_back":null,"category_grade":"easy","category_grade_text":null,"category_grade_skiing":null,"category_condition":"easy","category_condition_text":null,"cantons":[2],"photo_gallery":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0819b_s.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0697b.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0742b.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0834b.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0848b.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0886b.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0899b.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0944b.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg1067b.jpg"],"photo_gallery_big":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0819b_g.jpg","","","","","","","",""],"photo_gallery_urls":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"photo_gallery_ids":["216101","17707","17708","17710","17711","17712","17713","17714","17715"],"photo_gallery_copyright":["","","","","","","","",""],"photo_gallery_author":["","","","","","","","",""],"photo_gallery_coords":["","","","","","","","",""],"photo_gallery_abstract":["","","","","","","","",""],"photo_favorite":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0819b_s.jpg"],"photo_favorite_master":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-master/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0819b_M.jpg"],"photo_favorite_big":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0819b_g.jpg"],"photo_favorite_small":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-small/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg0819b_k.jpg"],"foto_teaser":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_613_lenzerheide_stromberg1020b_T.jpg"],"name":null,"name_2":null,"street":null,"zip":null,"place":null,"tel":null,"email":null,"url1_link":null,"change_date":"2026-05-27 12:23:24","desc_major_change_date":null,"geometry_last_major_change":"2026-05-27 10:20:31","segment_count":0,"bookable_ids":[],"group_ids":[281],"accommodation_ids":[37373,37465],"cycleservice_ids":[],"velorental_ids":[],"group_numbers":[12],"direction_ids":[1222],"arrival_ids":[399],"detour_ids":[],"goodtoknows":["399_Arrival","1222_Direction"],"type":"routen","title":"Churwaldner-Tour","r_number":"613","has_segment":false,"panel_hasnumber":true,"signal_way":"oneway","heightprofile_file":null,"url_de":"https://schweizmobil.ch/de/mountainbike/route-613","url_fr":"https://schweizmobil.ch/fr/mountain-bike/itineraire-613","url_it":"https://schweizmobil.ch/it/mountain-bike/percorso-613","url_en":"https://schweizmobil.ch/en/mountain-biking-in-switzerland/route-613","translations":{"de":{"abstract":"Die Churwaldner Tour ist eine ideale Feierabendtour. Aufgrund der geringen Höhenmeter und der niedrigen technischen und konditionellen Anforderungen ist sie aber auch für Familien und für E-Bikes geeignet.","description":"Ausgangspunkt dieser Rundtour ist das Informationsbüro in Churwalden. Die Tour startet mit einem gemütlichen Einrollen bis zum Chloster aus dem 12. Jahrhundert am Dorfrand von Churwalden. Danach führt uns die Route auf der Kiesstrasse Richtung Eggentobel und weiter bis zum malerischen Alpdorf Pradaschier. Von hier hat man einen sehr schönen Ausblick über Churwalden und kann sich auf der längsten Rodelbahn der Schweiz vergnügen. Die Tour geht weiter mit einer kurzen Abfahrt und der Überquerung des Rabiosa Bachs und zurück nach Churwalden.\n\nEin Abstecher zum beheizten Freibad in Churwalden sorgt für die nötige Erholung und Abkühlung und lässt den Tag angemessen ausklingen. Auf der Route laden verschiedene Restaurants zum Verweilen ein. Die Route eignet sich für Einsteiger, Familien und eBikes."},"fr":{"abstract":"Le circuit de Churwalden est un parcours tranquille. En raison du faible dénivelé et des faibles exigences techniques et physiques, il convient aux familles et aux adeptes du vélo électrique.","description":"L'office du tourisme de Churwalden constitue le point de départ de ce circuit. Le circuit débute par un agréable trajet jusqu'au couvent du 12e siècle situé à la périphérie du village de Churwalden. L'itinéraire nous mène ensuite sur la Kiesstrasse direction Eggentobel et continue jusqu'au pittoresque village alpin de Pradaschier, d'où l'on jouit d'une très belle vue sur Churwalden et où l'on peut s'amuser sur la plus longue piste de luge de Suisse. Le circuit se poursuit par une courte descente et la traversée du ruisseau de Rabiosa, puis se termine par le retour sur Churwalden.\n\nUn crochet par la piscine en plein air chauffée de Churwalden vous procurera la détente nécessaire et vous rafraîchira pour terminer harmonieusement la journée. Sur l'itinéraire, plusieurs restaurants invitent à un moment de détente. L'itinéraire est idéal pour les débutants, les familles et en vélo électrique."},"it":{"abstract":"Il tour Churwaldner è un ideale percorso serale. Grazie ai pochi metri di dislivello e le minime esigenze tecniche e di condizione, è adatto anche alle famiglie e le E-Bikes.","description":"Punto di partenza di questa escursione circolare è l'ufficio informazioni a Churwalden. Il tour inizia con una tranquilla pedalata fino all'abbazia del secolo XII, ai margini del villaggio di Churwalden. In seguito, si prosegue lungo una strada sterrata verso Eggentobel e poi fino al pittoresco paese alpino di Pradaschier. Da qui si può ammirare la splendida vista su Churwalden ed è anche possibile cimentarsi con tanto divertimento nella più lunga pista per slittini in Svizzera. Dopo una breve discesa e l'attraversamento del torrente Rabiosa, si rientra a Churwalden.\n\nUna sosta alla piscina all'aperto riscaldata di Churwalden assicura la giusta pausa rinfrescante per concludere al meglio la giornata. Lungo il percorso ci sono diversi ristoranti in cui fare delle piacevoli soste. Questa escursione è adatta per principianti, famiglie e biciclette elettriche."}}}}